<title>FRANCE: Britain's Blair to be on French TV Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Britain's Blair to be on French TV Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Prime Minister Tony Blair is to be interviewed on French television station TF1 on Tuesday at 1800 GMT, the privately-owned broadcaster announced.</p>
<p>Blair will be interviewed in London on the eve of a trip to Paris by star French anchor Patrick Poivre d'Arvor.</p>
<p>Blair is scheduled to attend a dinner with President Jacques Chirac on Wednesday in Paris.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
